# CUTLASS CUP: hold B with a full bar to charge; let go to swing the Super
# Shot, which costs one bar. With spare bars a longer charge upgrades it
# (faster) for the same one bar. Finn's is the Comet.
game cutlass
wait 5
cheat match 0 1
cheat cpu 1 0
wait 2
cheat play
cheat pos 0 60 100
cheat meter 0 2
hold B
wait 34
expect st0 == 6
cheat ball 70 100 0 0
release B
wait 8
expect ball_kind == 1
expect ball_level == 1
expect ball_team == 0
expect meter0 == 0
# three bars and a long charge: level 3, still one bar
cheat play
cheat pos 0 60 100
cheat meter 0 6
wait 20
hold B
wait 110
cheat ball 70 100 0 0
release B
wait 8
expect ball_kind == 1
expect ball_level == 3
expect meter0 == 4
expect ball_speed100 > 700
